==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Majestic Dawn|Leafeon|7}} from the {{TCG|Majestic Dawn}} expansion.
*'''Leafy Cyclone''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Astral Radiance|Leafeon|13}} from the {{TCG|Astral Radiance}} expansion.
